Drafting, reviewing, and negotiating key documents such as loan agreements, security documents, and project agreements;
Ensuring compliance with relevant laws, regulations, and industry standards;
Regularly providing clients with industry updates and legal opinions on industry trends; identifying potential legal risks and mitigation strategies;
Keeping abreast of trends in the industry;
Contributing to the business development of the Practice Area; amongst others.
