Job Summary
We are looking for a detail oriented and proactive individual with a good knowledge of cybersecurity principles and regulatory requirements, to ensure information security programmes are in compliance with applicable laws, regulations and policies to minimise or eliminate risk and audit findings.
S/he will develop business-relevant metrics to measure the efficiency and effectiveness of the programmes, facilitate appropriate resource allocation and enhance the maturity of the security and compliance programmes.
Responsibilities
Develop and maintain cybersecurity policies, standards, and procedures;
Conduct risk assessments and audits to identify vulnerabilities and ensure compliance with regulatory requirements;
Monitor and report effectiveness of security controls and governance processes;
Collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure implementation of effective cybersecurity controls in accordance to ISO 27001:2022 standard;
Assist in development and delivery of cybersecurity awareness and training programmes;
Support incident response activities and assist in investigation of security breaches;
Stay updated with latest cybersecurity trends, threats, and technologies;
Participate in development of security metrics and dashboards for executive reporting;
Ensure compliance with relevant laws, regulations, and industry standards (e.g., NDPR, ISO 27001);
Provide guidance and support to internal stakeholders on cybersecurity governance issues;
Management of all passwords e.g. Reset and admin privilege control and X-Gen User administration and reporting.
Person Specification & Required Qualification (s)
HND/bachelor’s degree in Science, Computer Science, Information Technology, Cybersecurity or any related discipline
2- 5 years’ cognate post NYSC experience in Cybersecurity Governance, Information Security, Risk Management, or Compliance.
Familiarity with cloud security frameworks and tools.
Experience within the Financial Services sector will be an added advantage
Experience in managing/working with senior stakeholders will be a distinct advantage.

